00:43:15,460 --> 00:43:23,140
And either haven't yet gotten the opportunity to do this with them, or maybe you've done it with them in the past and they've walked away from it.

667
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:39,180
And I want to acknowledge that tension and declare to you that the Lord loves your children, whether they have not yet made that decision or have made that decision and walked away from it.

668
00:43:39,180 --> 00:43:45,020
That the Lord loves your children far more than you could, far more than you could, and that he still has an eye on them.

669
00:43:45,020 --> 00:43:47,280
Keep praying this prayer over them.

670
00:43:47,280 --> 00:43:52,640
Keep demonstrating and declaring the gospel in ways that make sense and are helpful.

671
00:43:52,840 --> 00:43:55,460
And wait for the day when God does a work in their heart.

672
00:43:55,460 --> 00:44:05,900
And for you guys that are about to do it, like, don't lose sight of the miracle that today is.

673
00:44:05,900 --> 00:44:09,100
And keep being faithful.

674
00:44:09,100 --> 00:44:11,500
Keep demonstrating and declaring the gospel of Jesus.

675
00:44:11,500 --> 00:44:12,160
So we're going to sing.

676
00:44:12,160 --> 00:44:15,840
Parents are going to come baptize their children.

677
00:44:15,840 --> 00:44:17,940
