678
00:44:18,060 --> 00:44:18,940
Does that sound like a plan?

679
00:44:18,940 --> 00:44:20,560
Okay.

680
00:44:20,560 --> 00:44:21,500
Go ahead.

681
00:44:21,500 --> 00:44:34,300
Lord, bless you and keep you.

682
00:44:34,300 --> 00:44:41,620
Make his face shine upon you and be gracious to you.

683
00:44:41,980 --> 00:44:53,420
Lord, turn his face toward you and give you peace.

684
00:44:53,420 --> 00:45:07,200
Too long, but it's not going to be too short either.

685
00:45:08,640 --> 00:45:17,480
