Get the logistics here.

714
00:46:53,900 --> 00:46:55,480
All right.

715
00:46:55,480 --> 00:47:01,180
Well, then I baptize you in the name of the Father, and the Son, and the Holy Spirit.

716
00:47:04,720 --> 00:47:08,040
Amen.

717
00:47:08,040 --> 00:47:08,060
Amen.

