Those of you that know me now, I usually use a cry towel for these sorts of things.

722
00:48:04,240 --> 00:48:06,620
I got a very ugly cry.

723
00:48:06,620 --> 00:48:12,680
Brody, have you given your heart to the Lord Jesus Christ and asked him to be the Savior of your life?

724
00:48:12,680 --> 00:48:14,360
Yes.

725
00:48:14,360 --> 00:48:16,800
That's wonderful.

726
00:48:16,800 --> 00:48:20,340
Because of your public confession to the Lord, my son.

727
00:48:20,340 --> 00:48:21,520
I'm going to pray.

728
00:48:21,520 --> 00:48:21,840
I'm going to pray for you.

729
00:48:21,840 --> 00:48:21,920
I'm going to pray for you.

730
00:48:21,920 --> 00:48:22,340
I'm going to pray for you.

731
00:48:28,520 --> 00:48:56,320
Thank you, church.

732
00:48:56,320 --> 00:48:57,240
You're amazing.

